+The public site uses Midnight navigation and hero surfaces, warm-neutral content, and Petrol actions. Primary and destructive buttons retain a fixed dark fill and white text in both themes. Aqua identifies automation; Brass identifies attention, neither substitutes for a primary action. It explains a small number of meaningful outcomes before detailed capabilities. The signup CTA is primary; the product demonstration is secondary.
 
